# DESK03 run C -- select the C: icon, Remove desktop icon, Save desktop.
#   Proves the removal survives: the saved file then has no `#M` line, and the
#   `build_inf` fallback must NOT resurrect the icon on the next cold boot.
#   Options entry 4 = "Remove desktop icon" -> centre y 91
#           entry 11 = "Save desktop..."    -> centre y 203
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 38 39
1700 down
1703 up
1900 move 600 240
2300 mark B_SELECTED
2600 move 196 8
3000 move 200 91
3200 down
3203 up
3400 move 600 240
3900 mark C_REMOVED
4200 move 196 8
4600 move 200 203
4800 down
4803 up
5000 move 600 240
5800 mark D_SAVED
